  {"id":112,"x":340,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Pokekehekepi korgi","descriptions":["Great mounds of fine golden sand make up the huge swells of the korgi.  Constantly changing, as if a living organism, the dune lords shift periodically, and their surfaces slide uncontrollably as new hills and valleys appear."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"east","move":"east"}],"linksTo":"Map97_Korgi.xml"},
